    <div class="sok-container-fluid">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    
    
</div>

    </div>
    <div class="sok-container">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="title aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-e7321e9c22&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-02T17:00:13Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;2026 Candidate Filing Information&#34;}}" id="title-e7321e9c22" class="cmp-title">
    <h1 class="cmp-title__text">2026 Candidate Filing Information</h1>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-5e3df16caf&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-15T17:33:01Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Candidate filing for the 2026 elections for federal, state, legislative, county, and judicial offices will be held&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>April 1-3, 2026&amp;nbsp;(8 a.m. - 5 p.m.)&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-5e3df16caf" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Candidate filing for the 2026 elections for federal, state, legislative, county, and judicial offices will be held <b>April 1-3, 2026 (8 a.m. - 5 p.m.)</b></p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-9695689668&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-01-23T22:14:52Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/terms-of-office/2025-terms-of-office.pdf\&#34;>OFFICES ON THE BALLOT IN 2026&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-9695689668" class="cmp-text">
    <p><a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/terms-of-office/2025-terms-of-office.pdf">OFFICES ON THE BALLOT IN 2026</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="button button--colored aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">

    <a id="button-fd636743b8" class="cmp-button" href="https://filings.okelections.gov/ViewCandidates/2026040120260403/99/all" aria-label="2026 Candidate Filing - List of Candidates - Federal, State, Legislative, and Judicial Offices" target="_parent" data-cmp-clickable data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;button-fd636743b8&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/button&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-05-05T17:10:01Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;2026 Candidate Filing - List of Candidates - Federal, State, Legislative, and Judicial Offices Link&#34;,&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;https://filings.okelections.gov/ViewCandidates/2026040120260403/99/all&#34;}}">
        
    <span class="cmp-button__icon"></span>

        <span class="cmp-button__text">2026 Candidate Filing - List of Candidates - Federal, State, Legislative, and Judicial Offices Link</span>
    </a>
</div>
<div class="button button--colored aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    <a id="button-de4c0c6bb6" class="cmp-button" href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-list-book.pdf" target="_parent" data-cmp-clickable data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;button-de4c0c6bb6&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/button&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-04-03T23:37:21Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;2026 Candidate List Book&#34;,&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-list-book.pdf&#34;}}">
        
    <span class="cmp-button__icon"></span>

        <span class="cmp-button__text">2026 Candidate List Book</span>
    </a>
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-3c0a846ba4&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-05-05T17:09:48Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://oklahoma.gov/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information/2026-candidate-withdrawals.html\&#34; title=\&#34;2026 Candidate Withdrawals Link\&#34;>2026 Candidate Withdrawals&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://oklahoma.gov/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information/2026-contests-of-candidacy.html\&#34; title=\&#34;2026 Contests of Candidacy Link\&#34;>2026 Contests of Candidacy&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-3c0a846ba4" class="cmp-text">
    <p><a href="https://oklahoma.gov/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information/2026-candidate-withdrawals.html" title="2026 Candidate Withdrawals Link">2026 Candidate Withdrawals</a></p>
<p><a href="https://oklahoma.gov/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information/2026-contests-of-candidacy.html" title="2026 Contests of Candidacy Link">2026 Contests of Candidacy</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="title aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-726751d10e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2022-03-14T17:51:27Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;WHERE TO FILE &#34;}}" id="title-726751d10e" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">WHERE TO FILE </h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-de122bf5b2&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-15T17:33:17Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Candidates filing for federal, state, legislative or judicial offices file with the Secretary of the State Election Board at&amp;nbsp;the State Capitol. &lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Candidates filing for county offices file with the secretary of the appropriate &lt;a href=\&#34;https://oklahoma.gov/elections/about-us/county-election-boards.html\&#34;>county election board&lt;/a>.  &lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-de122bf5b2" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Candidates filing for federal, state, legislative or judicial offices file with the Secretary of the State Election Board at the State Capitol. <br />
</p>
<p>Candidates filing for county offices file with the secretary of the appropriate <a href="https://oklahoma.gov/elections/about-us/county-election-boards.html">county election board</a>.  </p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="title aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-2c8eb65c8e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2022-03-14T17:52:18Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;WHEN TO FILE &#34;}}" id="title-2c8eb65c8e" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">WHEN TO FILE </h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-5e480eafbb&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-14T18:51:01Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Candidates must submit a notarized Declaration of Candidacy, along with a filing fee or petition supporting their Declaration of Candidacy, Voter Registration Verification Form, and any other required documents &lt;b>April 1, 2, or 3 between 8 a.m. and 5 p.m.&lt;/b>  By state statute - early, late or incomplete submissions cannot be accepted. &lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-5e480eafbb" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Candidates must submit a notarized Declaration of Candidacy, along with a filing fee or petition supporting their Declaration of Candidacy, Voter Registration Verification Form, and any other required documents <b>April 1, 2, or 3 between 8 a.m. and 5 p.m.</b>  By state statute - early, late or incomplete submissions cannot be accepted. </p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="title aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-d8aa53fadb&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2022-03-14T17:53:15Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;FILING FEES AND PETITIONS &#34;}}" id="title-d8aa53fadb" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">FILING FEES AND PETITIONS </h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-50a1e8f071&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-02T17:33:01Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Candidates have the option to submit their notarized Declaration of Candidacy with a filing fee, in the form of a cashier’s check or certified check,&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>&lt;i>OR&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i>&lt;/b> a petition. (See &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/deliverdocument.asp?lookup=Next&amp;amp;listorder=13900&amp;amp;dbCode=STOKST26&amp;amp;year\&#34;>26 O.S. § 5-112&lt;/a>) &lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-50a1e8f071" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Candidates have the option to submit their notarized Declaration of Candidacy with a filing fee, in the form of a cashier’s check or certified check, <b><i>OR </i></b> a petition. (See <a href="https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/deliverdocument.asp?lookup&#61;Next&amp;listorder&#61;13900&amp;dbCode&#61;STOKST26&amp;year">26 O.S. § 5-112</a>) </p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="container responsivegrid aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    
    <div id="container-0d35d6510e" class="cmp-container">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="title aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-9f04c11def&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-02T17:36:13Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Filing Fees&#34;}}" id="title-9f04c11def" class="cmp-title">
    <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Filing Fees</h3>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text text--table aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-5c71f60a9b&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-15T16:54:25Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;table cellpadding=\&#34;1\&#34; cellspacing=\&#34;0\&#34; border=\&#34;1\&#34;>\r\n&lt;tbody>&lt;tr>&lt;th>Filing Fees&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>United States Senator&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$2,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>United State Representative&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>Governor&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$2,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>Lieutenant Governor&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>Attorney General&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>State Treasurer&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>State Superintendent of Public Instruction&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>State Auditor and Inspector&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>Commissioner of Labor&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>Insurance Commissioner&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>Corporation Commissioner&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$1,000.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>State Senator&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$750.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>State Representative&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$500.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>District Judge&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$500.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>Associate District Judge&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$500.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>District Attorney&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$500.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;tr>&lt;th>County Office&lt;/th>\r\n&lt;td>$300.00&lt;/td>\r\n&lt;/tr>&lt;/tbody>&lt;/table>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-5c71f60a9b" class="cmp-text">
    <p> </p>
<table cellpadding="1" cellspacing="0" border="1"><tbody><tr><th>Filing Fees</th><td> </td></tr><tr><th>United States Senator</th><td>$2,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>United State Representative</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>Governor</th><td>$2,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>Lieutenant Governor</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>Attorney General</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>State Treasurer</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>State Superintendent of Public Instruction</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>State Auditor and Inspector</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>Commissioner of Labor</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>Insurance Commissioner</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>Corporation Commissioner</th><td>$1,000.00</td></tr><tr><th>State Senator</th><td>$750.00</td></tr><tr><th>State Representative</th><td>$500.00</td></tr><tr><th>District Judge</th><td>$500.00</td></tr><tr><th>Associate District Judge</th><td>$500.00</td></tr><tr><th>District Attorney</th><td>$500.00</td></tr><tr><th>County Office</th><td>$300.00</td></tr></tbody></table>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="title aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-9ec8170adc&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-02T17:35:19Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Petitions&#34;}}" id="title-9ec8170adc" class="cmp-title">
    <h3 class="cmp-title__text">Petitions</h3>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="container responsivegrid aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    
    <div id="container-e122a76af4" class="cmp-container">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-a84b1a6ddf&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-25T19:14:01Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>A petition supporting a candidate’s filing must be signed by not fewer than two percent (2%) of the number of registered voters in the district, county or state, as appropriate for the office sought. (See&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/DeliverDocument.asp?CiteID=78496\&#34;>26 O.S. § 5-112&lt;/a>)&lt;br>\r\n&lt;br>\r\nThe official number of signatures required for each office is based on the number of registered voters as of November 1 of the year preceding the candidate filing period. (See &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.rules.ok.gov/code\&#34;>Okla. Admin. Code § 230:20-9-4&lt;/a>.) Signature requirements will be posted on this webpage when they become available after November 1, 2025.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The official petition form and instructions will be included in the Candidate Filing Packet and can also be downloaded below:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;i>&lt;b>Instructions and Official Petition Form&lt;/b>&lt;/i>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-petition-info/2026-candidate-petition-instructions.pdf\&#34;>Instructions for Filing a Petition&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-petition-info/2026-fed-state-leg-candidate-petition.pdf\&#34;>Petition for Federal, State, and Legislative Candidates&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-petition-info/2026-county-candidate-petition.pdf\&#34;>Petition for County Candidates&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-a84b1a6ddf" class="cmp-text">
    <p>A petition supporting a candidate’s filing must be signed by not fewer than two percent (2%) of the number of registered voters in the district, county or state, as appropriate for the office sought. (See <a href="https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/DeliverDocument.asp?CiteID&#61;78496">26 O.S. § 5-112</a>)<br />
<br />
The official number of signatures required for each office is based on the number of registered voters as of November 1 of the year preceding the candidate filing period. (See <a href="https://www.rules.ok.gov/code">Okla. Admin. Code § 230:20-9-4</a>.) Signature requirements will be posted on this webpage when they become available after November 1, 2025.</p>
<p>The official petition form and instructions will be included in the Candidate Filing Packet and can also be downloaded below:</p>
<p><i><b>Instructions and Official Petition Form</b></i></p>
<p><a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-petition-info/2026-candidate-petition-instructions.pdf">Instructions for Filing a Petition</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-petition-info/2026-fed-state-leg-candidate-petition.pdf">Petition for Federal, State, and Legislative Candidates</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/2026-candidate-filing-archives/2026-petition-info/2026-county-candidate-petition.pdf">Petition for County Candidates</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-c6b9759494&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-11-05T22:20:39Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;i>&lt;b>Signature Requirements&lt;/b>&lt;/i>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/signatures-required/20251101_state-federal-offices-signatures-required.pdf\&#34;>Signatures Required for State and Federal Offices&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/signatures-required/20251101_county-offices-signatures-required.pdf\&#34;>Signatures Required for County Offices&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-c6b9759494" class="cmp-text">
    <p><i><b>Signature Requirements</b></i></p>
<p><a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/signatures-required/20251101_state-federal-offices-signatures-required.pdf">Signatures Required for State and Federal Offices</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/signatures-required/20251101_county-offices-signatures-required.pdf">Signatures Required for County Offices</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>

    </div>

    
</div>

    
</div>

    </div>

    
</div>
<div class="title aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-82e186d9a3&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-01-21T22:19:32Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;CANDIDATE QUALIFICATIONS&#34;}}" id="title-82e186d9a3" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">CANDIDATE QUALIFICATIONS</h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-b64fdae870&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-14T19:40:12Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information/2026-candidate-qualifications.html\&#34;>2026 CANDIDATE QUALIFICATIONS BY OFFICE&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-b64fdae870" class="cmp-text">
    <p><a href="/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information/2026-candidate-qualifications.html">2026 CANDIDATE QUALIFICATIONS BY OFFICE</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="title aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;#candidatefilingpackets&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-01-21T21:25:55Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;CANDIDATE FILING PACKETS&#34;}}" id="#candidatefilingpackets" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">CANDIDATE FILING PACKETS</h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-cbffbdfd30&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-03-05T17:33:05Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>All candidates, with the exception of federal candidates, will need to provide a &lt;i>Voter Registration Verification Form&lt;/i>&lt;b> &lt;/b>with their Declaration of Candidacy. &lt;i>Voter Registration Verification Forms &lt;/i>can be downloaded from the &lt;a href=\&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/elections/ovp.html\&#34;>OK Voter Portal&lt;/a> or requested in person from the &lt;a href=\&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/elections/about-us/contact-us.html\&#34;>State Election Board&lt;/a> or the candidate&#39;s &lt;a href=\&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/elections/about-us/county-election-boards.html\&#34;>County Election Board&lt;/a>. &lt;b>The form must include the candidate&#39;s address.&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Candidates who are &lt;a href=\&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/elections/voter-registration/voter-privacy-programs.html\&#34;>Restricted Records&lt;/a> voters will need to go to their &lt;a href=\&#34;/content/sok-wcm/en/elections/about-us/county-election-boards.html\&#34;>County Election Board&lt;/a> office to request a copy of the Voter Registration Verification Form. The County Election Board staff will print the form, write the candidate&#39;s address information on the form and initial it. The initialed form must be included with the Candidate&#39;s Declaration of Candidacy.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Candidate filing packets may be obtained from the County Election Board or State Election Board or downloaded by selecting the appropriate Candidate Filing Packet below:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-cbffbdfd30" class="cmp-text">
    <p>All candidates, with the exception of federal candidates, will need to provide a <i>Voter Registration Verification Form</i><b> </b>with their Declaration of Candidacy. <i>Voter Registration Verification Forms </i>can be downloaded from the <a href="/elections/ovp.html">OK Voter Portal</a> or requested in person from the <a href="/elections/about-us/contact-us.html">State Election Board</a> or the candidate&#39;s <a href="/elections/about-us/county-election-boards.html">County Election Board</a>. <b>The form must include the candidate&#39;s address.</b></p>
<p>Candidates who are <a href="/elections/voter-registration/voter-privacy-programs.html">Restricted Records</a> voters will need to go to their <a href="/elections/about-us/county-election-boards.html">County Election Board</a> office to request a copy of the Voter Registration Verification Form. The County Election Board staff will print the form, write the candidate&#39;s address information on the form and initial it. The initialed form must be included with the Candidate&#39;s Declaration of Candidacy.</p>
<p>Candidate filing packets may be obtained from the County Election Board or State Election Board or downloaded by selecting the appropriate Candidate Filing Packet below: </p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-3c2f29785f&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-02-26T17:42:31Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;b>FEDERAL CANDIDATES&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-us-senator-us-rep-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>U.S. Senator&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-us-senator-us-rep-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>U.S. Representative&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>STATE CANDIDATES&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>Governor&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>Lieutenant Governor&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>Attorney General&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>State Treasurer&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>State Superintendent of Public Instruction&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-state-auditor-inspector-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>State Auditor and Inspector&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-labor-commissioner-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>Commissioner of Labor&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-insurance-commissioner-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>Insurance Commissioner&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-corporation-commissioner-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>Corporation Commissioner&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>LEGISLATIVE CANDIDATES&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-state-senator-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>State Senator&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-state-representative-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>State Representative&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>DISTRICT JUDGES AND DISTRICT ATTORNEY&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-district-judge-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>District Judge&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-associate-district-judge-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>Associate District Judge&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-district-attorney-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>District Attorney&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>COUNTY CANDIDATES&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-county-commissioner-filing%20packet.pdf\&#34;>County Commissioner - District 1 &amp;amp; District 3&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-county-officers-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>County Assessor&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-county-officers-filing-packet.pdf\&#34;>County Treasurer&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-3c2f29785f" class="cmp-text">
    <p><b>FEDERAL CANDIDATES</b></p>
<p><a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-us-senator-us-rep-filing-packet.pdf">U.S. Senator</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-us-senator-us-rep-filing-packet.pdf">U.S. Representative</a></p>
<p><b>STATE CANDIDATES</b></p>
<p><a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf">Governor</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf">Lieutenant Governor</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf">Attorney General</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf">State Treasurer</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-governor-state-officers-filing-packet.pdf">State Superintendent of Public Instruction</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-state-auditor-inspector-filing-packet.pdf">State Auditor and Inspector</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-labor-commissioner-filing-packet.pdf">Commissioner of Labor</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-insurance-commissioner-filing-packet.pdf">Insurance Commissioner</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-corporation-commissioner-filing-packet.pdf">Corporation Commissioner</a></p>
<p><b>LEGISLATIVE CANDIDATES</b></p>
<p><a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-state-senator-filing-packet.pdf">State Senator</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-state-representative-filing-packet.pdf">State Representative</a></p>
<p><b>DISTRICT JUDGES AND DISTRICT ATTORNEY</b></p>
<p><a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-district-judge-filing-packet.pdf">District Judge</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-associate-district-judge-filing-packet.pdf">Associate District Judge</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-district-attorney-filing-packet.pdf">District Attorney</a></p>
<p><b>COUNTY CANDIDATES</b></p>
<p><a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-county-commissioner-filing%20packet.pdf">County Commissioner - District 1 &amp; District 3</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-county-officers-filing-packet.pdf">County Assessor</a><br />
<a href="/content/dam/ok/en/elections/candidate-filing-archives/candidate-filing-packets/2026-candidate-filing-packets/2026-county-officers-filing-packet.pdf">County Treasurer</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="title aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-28b6b229ab&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2022-03-14T17:57:49Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;WITHDRAWAL OF CANDIDACY &#34;}}" id="title-28b6b229ab" class="cmp-title">
    <h2 class="cmp-title__text">WITHDRAWAL OF CANDIDACY </h2>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="card aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

   
    <div class="cmp-card" style="background-repeat:round;background-image: url();">
        <div class="cmp-card__icon">
            <i class="fas fa-landmark" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-card__heading">
            <h2>2026 CANDIDATE WITHDRAWALS</h2>
            
        </div>
        <div class="button button--colored">

    
        <a id="button-44d8855102" class="cmp-button" href="/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information/2026-candidate-withdrawals.html" role="button" target="_self" data-cmp-clickable data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;button-44d8855102&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/button/v1/button&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-04-07T19:54:40Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;List of Candidate Withdrawals&#34;,&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/elections/candidates/2026-candidate-filing-information/2026-candidate-withdrawals.html&#34;}}">

            
            
                
    

                <span class="cmp-button__text">List of Candidate Withdrawals</span>
            

        </a>
    
    
    

</div>

    </div>

   
   



    
</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-f5842c7ff5&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-07-03T16:54:48Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;i>&lt;b>Primary Election&lt;/b>&lt;/i>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>A candidate may withdraw from the Primary Election by filing a written notice with the Secretary of the State Election Board before 5:00 p.m. on the second business day following the close of the filing period – &lt;b>Tuesday, April 7, 2026&lt;/b>.  (See &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/DeliverDocument.asp?CiteID=439347\&#34;>26 O.S. § 5-115&lt;/a>)  &lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;i>&lt;b>Runoff Primary Election&lt;/b>&lt;/i>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>A candidate may withdraw from the Runoff Primary Election by  filing a written notice before 5:00 p.m. on Friday following the Primary Election –&lt;b> Friday, June 19, 2026.&lt;/b>  (See &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/deliverdocument.asp?lookup=Next&amp;amp;listorder=14300&amp;amp;dbCode=STOKST26&amp;amp;year=\&#34;>26 O.S. § 5-116&lt;/a>) &lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;i>&lt;b>General Election &lt;/b>&lt;/i>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>A candidate may withdraw from the General Election by filing a written notice before 5:00 p.m. on the Friday following the Runoff Primary Election –&lt;b> Friday, August 28, 2026&lt;/b>. (See &lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/DeliverDocument.asp?CiteID=78501\&#34;>26 O.S. § 5-116.1&lt;/a>) &lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-f5842c7ff5" class="cmp-text">
    <p><i><b>Primary Election</b></i><br />
</p>
<p>A candidate may withdraw from the Primary Election by filing a written notice with the Secretary of the State Election Board before 5:00 p.m. on the second business day following the close of the filing period – <b>Tuesday, April 7, 2026</b>.  (See <a href="https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/DeliverDocument.asp?CiteID&#61;439347">26 O.S. § 5-115</a>)  </p>
<p><i><b>Runoff Primary Election</b></i></p>
<p>A candidate may withdraw from the Runoff Primary Election by  filing a written notice before 5:00 p.m. on Friday following the Primary Election –<b> Friday, June 19, 2026.</b>  (See <a href="https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/deliverdocument.asp?lookup&#61;Next&amp;listorder&#61;14300&amp;dbCode&#61;STOKST26&amp;year&#61;">26 O.S. § 5-116</a>) </p>
<p><i><b>General Election </b></i></p>
<p>A candidate may withdraw from the General Election by filing a written notice before 5:00 p.m. on the Friday following the Runoff Primary Election –<b> Friday, August 28, 2026</b>. (See <a href="https://www.oscn.net/applications/oscn/DeliverDocument.asp?CiteID&#61;78501">26 O.S. § 5-116.1</a>) </p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="container responsivegrid aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    
    <div id="container-1eea7e0344" class="cmp-container">
        


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-76d4c1d6de&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;sok-wcm/components/content/v1/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-01-23T17:55:30Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;b>CANDIDATE WITHDRAWAL FORMS&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-76d4c1d6de" class="cmp-text">
    <p><b>CANDIDATE WITHDRAWAL FORMS</b></p>

